message: "If you use Gibbus in research, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "Gibbus"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Salib"
    given-names: "Daniel"
version: "0.1.0"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DanJSal/gibbus"
url: "https://github.com/DanJSal/gibbus"
abstract: >-
  Flexible maximum-likelihood modeling of smooth univariate log-concave
  distributions, with support-aware modeling, interval-censored observations,
  and optional finite mixtures for multimodal data.
keywords:
  - "log-concave distributions"
  - "maximum likelihood"
  - "density estimation"
  - "statistical inference"
  - "censored data"
  - "mixture models"
